OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds attend canal festival at
OL,4,Asite of breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people attended a canal
OL,7,Ffestival on Saturday, despite much of
OL,8,Fthe nearby waterway being shut due to a
OL,9,Fbreach just before Christmas last year.
OL,11,FThe 25th Whitchurch Canal Festival
OL,12,Faimed to encourage more people to use
OL,13,Fthe canal, and included live music,
OL,14,Fhistoric and trading boats, and
OL,15,Factivities.
OL,17,FA major incident was declared after the
OL,18,Fbreach on the Llangollen Canal which
OL,19,Fsaw two boats fall into a hole after
OL,20,Fwater spilled into a nearby field.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
