OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds attend canal festival at
OL,4,Asite of breach
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Obviously the breach has had a massive
OL,7,Fimpact on the tourism on the canal but
OL,8,Fof course it's brought a lot more
OL,9,Fpeople in as well to come and see
OL,10,Fwhat's going on," said Doug Sealy from
OL,11,Fthe Whitchurch Waterway Trust, which
OL,12,Forganised the event.
